</thead>
<tbody>
<tr class="border-b border-[#24170f]/10 align-top">
<td class="p-3">Testing SMS for the first time</td>
<td class="p-3">Free tier or low-commitment usage</td>
<td class="p-3">Omnisend, Brevo, Privy</td>
<td class="p-3">Capture quality before send volume</td>
</tr>
<tr class="border-b border-[#24170f]/10 align-top">
<td class="p-3">Steady recovery and campaign volume</td>
<td class="p-3">Usage-based SMS with transparent rates</td>
<td class="p-3">Postscript, SMSBump, Firepush</td>
<td class="p-3">MMS share and carrier surcharges</td>
</tr>
<tr class="border-b border-[#24170f]/10 align-top">
<td class="p-3">Email-heavy lifecycle beside SMS</td>
<td class="p-3">Pay-per-email without contact tiers</td>
<td class="p-3">Sequenzy (email) beside a dedicated SMS provider</td>
<td class="p-3">Integration handoff and attribution overlap</td>
</tr>
<tr class="border-b border-[#24170f]/10 align-top">
