<td class="p-3">Profile-based with segment hygiene tooling</td>
<td class="p-3">Klaviyo, Drip</td>
<td class="p-3">Dormant profiles inflating the bill</td>
</tr>
<tr class="border-b border-[#24170f]/10 align-top">
<td class="p-3">High-volume acquisition program</td>
<td class="p-3">Custom enterprise contract</td>
